      value: Jake
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[4].dialogues.Array.data[19].name
      value: Dung
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[1].dialogues.Array.data[9].dialogueContent
      value: Good jobs.You have my recognition
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[2].dialogues.Array.data[0].dialogueContent
      value: "Solid work on the stone. \nNow get yourself ready."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[2].dialogues.Array.data[1].dialogueContent
      value: "You won't survive out there \nwith just your bare hands."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[2].dialogues.Array.data[2].dialogueContent
      value: "Head Northwest. Find the cabin. \nBuy a Pistol from the dealer."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[2].dialogues.Array.data[3].dialogueContent
      value: "It's loaded? Good. Keep it close. \nYou're gonna need it soon."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[2].dialogues.Array.data[4].dialogueContent
      value: "It's loaded? Good. Keep it close. \nYou're gonna need it soon."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[2].dialogues.Array.data[5].dialogueContent
      value: "You have strength, and you have obedience. \nThat is rare. Right now,
        the Scavengers bring food, \nbut the walls are weak."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[2].dialogues.Array.data[6].dialogueContent
      value: "Wood burns, Jake. We need something \npermanent. Something that lasts
        forever."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[2].dialogues.Array.data[7].dialogueContent
      value: "I need Stone. Lots of it. We are going to \nturn this camp into a fortress."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[2].dialogues.Array.data[8].dialogueContent
      value: "Solid work. Wood rots, but stone... \nstone is forever."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[2].dialogues.Array.data[9].dialogueContent
      value: Good jobs.You have my recognition
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[0].dialogueContent
      value: "(Shivering slightly) It\u2019s too quiet \nout there, D\u0169ng. Does
        the wind \nalways sound like\u2026 whispering?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[1].dialogueContent
      value: "(Stops sharpening, looks up) \nYou get used to it. Or you go crazy.
        \nThose are your only two options here."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[2].dialogueContent
      value: You talk like this forest is alive.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[3].dialogueContent
      value: "It is, Jake. But not in the way\nyou think. Listen to me. There \nis
        a secret about this soil."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[4].dialogueContent
      value: A secret?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[5].dialogueContent
      value: "The things out there ,the walkers\ndon't migrate here. They manifest.\nOne
        minute, you\u2019re standing in a\nclear meadow, and the next,\na monstrosity
        is breathing down\nyour neck. No warning. No origin."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[6].dialogueContent
      value: "That\u2019s impossible. Things \nhave to come from somewhere."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[7].dialogueContent
      value: 'Not here. When I first arrived with the

        pioneers... God, it
        was different.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[8].dialogueContent
      value: How different?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[9].dialogueContent
      value: 'It was a paradise.The sun actually

        felt warm. We slept on
        the grass

        without guards.Then came the

        We woke up, and
        half our group

        was just... gone. Replaced by those

        things.
        Since then, the forest has

        been trying to swallow us whole.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[4].dialogues.Array.data[0].dialogueContent
      value: "It\u2019s done, D\u0169ng. Fifteen of them. \nI actually made it back
        alive."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[4].dialogues.Array.data[1].dialogueContent
      value: "(Hands him a sealed letter) Good.\nNow take this to \"The Officer\"
        at the \nold cemetery. He is the Gravekeeper \nof this forest."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[4].dialogues.Array.data[2].dialogueContent
      value: 'The Gravekeeper? Why do we need

        to contact him?'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[4].dialogues.Array.data[3].dialogueContent
      value: 'The Gravekeeper? Why do we need

        to contact him?'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[4].dialogues.Array.data[4].dialogueContent
      value: "He manages the tombs of everyone \nwho... ends up here. Give him this,
        \nbut DO NOT open it."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[4].dialogues.Array.data[5].dialogueContent
      value: "Understood. Just a delivery to \nthe graveyard."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[4].dialogues.Array.data[6].dialogueContent
      value: "Go. He needs to know exactly how \nbig of a grave to dig for the new
        arrival \nmentioned inside."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[4].dialogues.Array.data[7].dialogueContent
      value: 'Not here. When I first arrived with the

        pioneers... God, it
        was different.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[4].dialogues.Array.data[8].dialogueContent
      value: How different?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[4].dialogues.Array.data[9].dialogueContent
      value: 'It was a paradise.The sun actually

        felt warm. We slept on
        the grass

        without guards.Then came the

        We woke up, and
        half our group

        was just... gone. Replaced by those

        things.
        Since then, the forest has

        been trying to swallow us whole.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[5].dialogues.Array.data[0].dialogueContent
      value: "You handled the Officer well. \nNow, you need to integrate. \nYou cannot
        survive alone."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[5].dialogues.Array.data[1].dialogueContent
      value: "Integration? I thought this was \njust a survival camp, not a social
        club."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[5].dialogues.Array.data[2].dialogueContent
      value: "Connections are armor, Jake. \nGo meet the others. Start with Hoang.\nHe
        is my right hand; if I am not here, \nhis word is law."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[5].dialogues.Array.data[3].dialogueContent
      value: Got it. Anyone else?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[5].dialogues.Array.data[4].dialogueContent
      value: "There is Mu. She is usually near the \nleft down corner. She is...
        quiet, \nbut sharp. Get to know them. \nThey will be your family soon."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[5].dialogues.Array.data[5].dialogueContent
      value: "Understood. Just a delivery to \nthe graveyard."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[5].dialogues.Array.data[6].dialogueContent
      value: "Go. He needs to know exactly how \nbig of a grave to dig for the new
        arrival \nmentioned inside."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[10].dialogueContent
      value: "So, we\u2019re just sitting ducks \nwaiting to die?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[11].dialogueContent
      value: "No. We are survivors. But \nsurvival isn't given, it\u2019s earned."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[12].dialogueContent
      value: What do you mean?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[13].dialogueContent
      value: "I can\u2019t babysit you forever. \nIf you want to stay in this camp,
        \nyou need to prove you\u2019re not a liability."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[14].dialogueContent
      value: "You want me to fight? Now?\nIt\u2019s pitch black!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[15].dialogueContent
      value: "Fear is the best teacher. There\u2019s \na cluster of them, near the
        old creek. \nThey are mindless, but they bite hard."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[16].dialogueContent
      value: "You\u2019re joking."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[17].dialogueContent
      value: "Look at my face. Do I look like \nI\u2019m joking? You need reflexes.
        \nYou need to harden your heart."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[18].dialogueContent
      value: How many?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[19].dialogueContent
      value: "Kill 15 of them. Don't come back \nuntil you do. If you can handle
        \nfifteen slow ones, maybe you\u2019ll\nsurvive when the fast ones spawn."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[3].dialogues.Array.data[20].dialogueContent
      value: Greattttt! I know you can do it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[4].dialogues.Array.data[10].dialogueContent
      value: "So, we\u2019re just sitting ducks \nwaiting to die?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[4].dialogues.Array.data[11].dialogueContent
      value: "No. We are survivors. But \nsurvival isn't given, it\u2019s earned."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[4].dialogues.Array.data[12].dialogueContent
      value: What do you mean?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogues.Array.data[4].dialogues.Array.data[13].dialogueContent
      value: "I can\u2019t babysit you forever. \nIf you want to stay in this camp,
        \nyou need to prove you\u2019re not a liability."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2597713784979025642, guid: 9cc81567f03c34f4284842a5b397a14f, type: 3}
